<div class="hometext bgEmployibilityIndex" style="padding-top:15px">
    <p class="paraHeader">Dream Jobs - A Career DNA Reality Check </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">
        <i>Not a job you chase. A job that fits your life.</i><br />
        Most people don’t fail at careers because they lack talent. They struggle because they never pause to ask what actually matters to them. This self-test helps you do exactly that; honestly, calmly, and without judgement.
    </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"><b>Most Plan B Jobs also turn out to be Dream Jobs…</b> </p>
    <hr />
    <p class="paraCommon"><b>A gentle note before you begin</b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">This is not an exam. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">It’s not careers counselling. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">And it’s not a push toward any “ideal” path. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">It’s simply a structured pause to understand what kind of work, environment, and life fit <b>make sense</b> at this stage. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"><i>You can keep returning to this anytime. Because as life changes, your dream job definition will too.</i> </p>
    <hr />
    <p class="paraCommon"><b>Poll 1. Reality Priorities Check</b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"><b><i>Fast answers. Honest instincts.</i></b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">This is a quick, first-level assessment designed to capture your <b>natural reactions.</b> Money, stability, growth, brand, work-life balance etc. the things we all think about, but don’t always admit openly. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">
        You’ll answer <b>15 short questions</b> based on instinct, not overthinking. There are no right or wrong choices, only signals about what you prioritize right now in life and work.
    </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">
        Think of this layer as a mirror, not a verdict.
        <a href="/visitor/poll/48" class="homeImage"><img src="~/images/audience-poll.png" width="70px" /></a>
    </p>
    <hr />
    <p class="paraCommon"><b>Poll 2. Deep Dive - Situations & Decisions</b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"><b><i>Slow thinking. Real-life choices.</i></b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">This layer goes deeper in to everyday realities: <b>salary pressure, family expectations, relocation, job security, ambition, peace of mind, and growth.</b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">Here you reflect on your own <b>beliefs, experiences, and undercurrents</b> that shape your own decisions - often more clearly. This could take time. And that’s intentional. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"> <a href="/visitor/poll/49" class="homeImage"><img src="~/images/audience-poll.png" width="70px" /></a> </p>
    <hr />
    <p class="paraCommon"><b>Poll 3. Community Lens</b> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"><i>Your answers don’t sit alone. They live inside a bigger picture.</i> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">Most people aren’t looking for advice. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon">They’re looking for social reassurance without peer pressure. </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"> <a href="/visitor/poll/55" class="homeImage"><img src="~/images/audience-poll.png" width="70px" /></a> </p>
    <p class="paraCommon"> </p>
   
